  "body": "Welcome to a home where modern style, thoughtful renovations, and effortless living come together. Nestled in a peaceful setting with a tranquil outlook over established trees, this beautifully presented home offers the perfect balance of comfort, privacy, and convenience.\r\n\r\nLovingly renovated throughout, this three-bedroom, two-bathroom home is move-in ready, allowing you to simply unpack and enjoy.\r\n\r\nStep outside onto the new deck, where seamless indoor-outdoor flow creates the perfect setting for morning coffee, summer barbecues, or simply unwinding after a long day. Designed for busy lifestyles, this is true lock-up-and-leave living with minimal maintenance and maximum enjoyment.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in the heart of Millwater, you'll enjoy the very best of the Hibiscus Coast lifestyle. Spend weekends at nearby Orewa Beach, explore local cafés and restaurants, shop at Silverdale Mall, or take advantage of the quick motorway access and nearby park-and-ride for an easy commute. Families will appreciate being zoned for the highly regarded Silverdale School and Orewa College, while parks and playgrounds are just moments away.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for your first home, downsizing without compromise, or securing a quality investment in one of the area's most desirable locations, this home delivers exceptional value and a lifestyle that's hard to beat.\r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love: \r\n•  Two beautifully renovated, fully tiled bathrooms\r\n•  Stylishly renovated kitchen and living area\r\n•  New deck, perfect for entertaining and outdoor living\r\n•  Large floored attic plus multiple cupboards and wardrobes providing exceptional storage\r\n•  Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n•  Spacious single garage, private driveway parking, plus additional on-street parking\r\n\r\nHomes that combine quality renovations, a peaceful setting, and such a sought-after location are always in demand. Don't miss your opportunity to secure this stunning Millwater home. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing, we'd love to show you through.\r\n\r\nCall Sid: 021 029 47445\r\nText or Email Nicole: 021 023 30763, nicolelchambers1@gmail.com",
